# Regular expressions. The clean uniform interface; the per-env native implementation wraps the platform's regex engine and is selected at build time, hidden behind the API.

load @term/base/code/native/regex
  find do-matches
  find do-replace
  find do-find

task matches
  take pattern, like text
  take input, like text
  like boolean
  send back
    call do-matches
      read pattern
      read input

task replace
  take pattern, like text
  take input, like text
  take replacement, like text
  like text
  send back
    call do-replace
      read pattern
      read input
      read replacement

task find
  take pattern, like text
  take input, like text
  like text
  send back
    call do-find
      read pattern
      read input
